  "action": "question",
  "question_count": 1,
  "is_atomic": true,
  "atomic_questions": [
    "Is the objective to minimize the time at which the last batch finishes in vat 3 (i.e., the makespan measured at the end of the final stage), or is there a different completion-time definition you have in mind?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for a single policy choice regarding the definition of the objective function (makespan vs. other completion-time definitions)."
}

{
  "action": "question",
  "question_count": 1,
  "is_atomic": true,
  "atomic_questions": [
    "Are the vats identical in any sense, or does each vat have a fixed identity such that batch i's processing time in vat j is exactly the value given in row i, column j of the matrix (so the matrix is a per-batch, per-vat table rather than a set of interchangeable machines)?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response contains a single clarification question asking for a policy choice regarding the nature of the vats (identical vs. fixed identity), which constitutes one independent semantic request."
}

