  "atomic_questions": [
    "Is there any limit on how many batches a single vat can process, or can each vat process any number of batches (one at a time) as long as they don't overlap?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks a single clarification question regarding the capacity limit of a vat, presenting two mutually exclusive options for the user to choose from."
}

